WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.634
-Well, finally, guys, since today is 4/20,

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:03.834
I actually...

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:07.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:09.267
I actually wrote a song to celebrate the holiday.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:10.801
But then I realized, you know what?

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:13.167
Kids watch this show, and I got to set a good example.

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:16.667
So I changed the song to be about Earth Day instead.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.701
And you could barely notice the difference in the lyrics.

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:19.767
Let's do this.

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:20.968
Roots, can you give me a little tune?

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:23.267
What's a good song?

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:25.300
[ Reggae music plays ]

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:33.567
♪♪

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:36.667
♪ It's a glorious day, so I'll sing you a song ♪

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.033
♪ But first you've got to sit down ♪

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:40.367
♪ And light up your... LED light bulbs ♪

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:43.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.934
♪ Sit in a circle and try not to choke ♪

00:00:45.934 --> 00:00:48.601
♪ As the room fills up with a whole bunch of... ♪

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:49.968
Reusable tote bags.

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:54.567
♪ The room's gettin' hot, kind of feels like a sauna ♪

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:57.934
♪ That's on the account of dank carbon emissions ♪

00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:59.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.634
♪ Now, if you're feeling buzzed, I'm not talking mosquitoes ♪

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:05.100
♪ You want to eat a large bag of cool ranch... ♪

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.934
Organic seaweed crisps.

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:08.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:11.400
♪ Let me wrap things up, here's my final point ♪

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.167
♪ We should all get together and light a... ♪

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:17.667
Sign that says "Save the Earth."

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:18.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:20.634
Yeah, it's better.

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:21.634
We have a great show!

